      "outcome": "After the withdrawal of 1242, Béla worked to restore population, production and defences. Scholarship assesses differing roles for imperial succession, military resistance, supply and environmental conditions in explaining the withdrawal. Devastation left lasting demographic and settlement losses, while reconstruction changed fortification and relations between crown and local elites.",
