      "body": "Representatives met to resolve the Western Schism involving three papal claimants. Martin V’s election in 1417 reunited the main obediences. The council also condemned Jan Hus, who was executed. The papal conclave used the harbour warehouse; sessions met in churches including the cathedral.",
