      "body": "Issued in April 1598, the Edict of Nantes sought to establish peace through negotiated religious coexistence. It protected Huguenot civil status, education and access to office, and authorized worship in specified places. At the same time it restored Catholic worship and property and retained substantial geographical restrictions on Protestant practice. Secret articles and separate documents concerning funding and security towns supplemented the principal edict. The principal edict, supporting arrangements, judicial registration and local enforcement together formed a complex system for maintaining civil peace.",
