      "outcome": "The settlement gave Huguenots a more stable legal position, but courts such as the Parlement of Paris required pressure to register it, and local implementation varied. Political and military guarantees were weakened under Louis XIII while some worship protections survived. Louis XIV progressively narrowed the arrangement before revoking its core provisions in 1685. Persecution and flight exposed the vulnerability of coexistence dependent on monarchical policy.",
