      "body": "After publication of the Dialogue Concerning the Two Chief World Systems, Galileo was summoned to Rome. The proceedings concerned his compliance with the 1616 restrictions on Copernican teaching and his treatment of Earth’s motion as a physical reality. On 22 June 1633 the court found him vehemently suspected of heresy and required an abjuration. The sentence of imprisonment was implemented through supervised residence; he eventually returned to Arcetri near Florence.",
