      "body": "With Edmond Halley’s encouragement, editorial assistance and financial support, Isaac Newton’s Mathematical Principles of Natural Philosophy appeared in London. The work formulated laws of motion and developed gravitation mathematically to address planetary orbits, comets, tides and related problems. It transformed earlier achievements by Kepler, Galileo and others, while emerging amid disputes over contributions and priority involving figures such as Robert Hooke.",
