      "outcome": "The losses gravely weakened France’s field armies and cavalry, prompting allies and subordinate states to reassess French power. Russian forces advanced westward and a renewed coalition emerged, defeating Napoleon at Leipzig in 1813. The occupation of Moscow became a turning point in the reversal of imperial expansion.",
