      "body": "In October 1922, Fascist Blackshirts mobilized around the capital and threatened a seizure of power. King Victor Emmanuel III refused to approve the government’s proposed state of siege and invited Benito Mussolini to form a ministry. Mussolini arrived in Rome on 30 October and his government took office on 31 October. His appointment depended on both organized violence and cooperation from the monarchy and conservative elites, rather than a victorious battle for the capital. The initial coalition government subsequently narrowed political competition.",
