          "title": "Secures radium in Bordeaux",
          "text": "As German forces approached Paris, Curie took the laboratory’s precious radium to Bordeaux and secured it in a safe-deposit box before returning. Protecting scientific material and preparing wartime medical services became parallel demands on her work."
